==Spanish==

===Etymology===
Syncope of {{m|es|todo}}

===Pronunciation===
{{es-pr}}

===Adjective===
{{es-adj|inv=1}}

# {{label|es|intensifier|informal}} [[very]], [[mega]]
#: {{ux|es|Es to' perita.|It's really cool.}}

===Determiner===
{{head|es|determiner}}

# {{label|es|informal}} {{contraction of|es|todo}}
# {{label|es|informal}} {{contraction of|es|todos}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|es|pronoun}}

# {{label|es|informal}} {{contraction of|es|todo}}

===Usage notes===
The adjective intensifier sense only occurs in the contracted for "to'", never the original form [[todo]].

